WEBVTT

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:10.650
Ichijiku, ninjin, sansho, shiitake.

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:17.240
Gobou, mukuroju, nanakusa, hatsutake.

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:21.030
Kyuuri, tougan.

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:43.470
Ichijiku, ninjin, sansho, shiitake.

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:50.600
Gobou, mukuroju, nanakusa, hatsutake.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:54.060
Kyuuri, tougan.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:03:02.070
Ichijiku, ninjin, sansho, shiitake.

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:06.200
Gobou, mukuroju...

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:03.340
Ichijiku, ninjin, sansho, shiitake...

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:06.260
<b>Chapter Three: Kamaitachi
Ichijiku, ninjin, sansho, shiitake...</b>

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:08.010
<b>Chapter Three: Kamaitachi</b>

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:57.400
He really did it.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.860
Yeah.

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:02.110
The Hachimaki-Giri is Instructor Ushimata's special technique.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:05.030
When did Irako master it?

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:06.700
Natural talent.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:10.620
What he was born with is probably different from ours...

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:14.790
He's improved that much in just one year after joining our dojo.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:21.420
By comparison,
Assistant Instructor Fujiki is hardly noticed these days...

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:26.800
With the way things are, the successor of the Kogan Style may...

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.250
Fujiki...

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:10.590
One year sure passes quickly...

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:23.270
Yes...

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:29.700
I've come this far within just one year...

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.120
Iwamoto Kogan...

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:39.750
The secret swordplay techniques hidden in his demented state...

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.380
Iwamoto Mie...

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:48.880
A vessel that will eventually give
birth to a successor of the Kogan Style...

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:53.430
I'll get the Kogan Style...

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:55.720
I'll suck everything out of it...

00:06:57.350 --> 00:07:00.690
Thank you for your loyal patronage.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:04.730
Put it on the tab for the Iwamoto household.

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:06.650
Yes, of course.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:08.860
Please take care, madam.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:10.150
Goodbye.

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:55.620
Neri, huh?

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:58.200
How enthusiastic... or rather...

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:02.830
...curious you really are to try my way of training...

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:11.880
I have a request.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:13.630
No.

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:18.390
You are never to have a practice match with Irako.

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:22.180
If you do, it won't be just practice.

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:23.310
Fujiki...

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:26.860
You're Naka-Mokuroku in the Kogan Style.

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:29.900
Why are you so worked up about practice at the dojo?

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:34.410
That bastard lacks the etiquette of martial arts.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:37.280
His behavior sets a bad example for the others, so...

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:38.740
That's absurd.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:43.790
There's something else weighing on your mind...

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:48.380
Something that disturbs your mind and dulls your swordplay.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:52.090
Did you think that I wouldn't see through it?

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.850
F-Father!

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:43.060
It's me, Mie!

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:45.350
I'm not Iku!

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:49.860
I'm not Iku!

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:10.960
Mie...

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:13.960
The vessel has finally become ready.

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:21.890
I'm taking a bath.

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:23.890
Ah... Yes, sir.

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:32.940
Kogan snaps out of his demented
state most often from fall to winter.

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:35.400
The duration he is normal is half a day at longest.

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:40.910
During that short period of time,
he gives instructions on the dojo...

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:45.540
...and the apprentices seek them in detail.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:47.540
That's the Kogan Style practice.

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:54.420
Gonza...

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:55.710
Yes, sir?

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:58.090
Who do you think should be the Kogan Style's successor?

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:01.430
Fujiki or Irako?

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.810
Fujiki Gennosuke, I think.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:07.180
Why is that?

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:10.350
It's because he respects Mie-dono.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:14.270
Raise your head.

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:20.200
What did you just say?

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:22.200
What about Mie?

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:25.620
If only...

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:29.710
If only she had been born a boy...

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:30.790
Answer to me.

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:35.710
I'm asking Fujiki and Irako, which has a stronger breed...

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:39.170
Even...

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:41.470
You'd say they stand even, right?

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:53.730
Funaki Ichidensai in Nissaka has twin sons, right?

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:57.230
The heads, Gonza...

00:11:57.690 --> 00:12:00.740
Bring me the heads of Funaki's sons...

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:03.990
Send Fujiki and Irako there.

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:08.660
I'll choose whoever completes the order to carry on my lineage.

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:16.840
<b>What does the demon's smile herald?</b>

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.760
Funaki Ichidensai in Kakegawa Domain...

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:29.180
...has been called a master swordsman since the Keichou era.

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:35.190
In his dojo, a special swordplay
technique is performed every spring.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:37.020
Big brother!

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.020
All right!

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:44.860
Funaki Hyouma and Kazuma...

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:47.280
They have mastered the secret of Kabuto-Nage...

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:51.000
...and are fully proficient in the Funaki Style.

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:54.040
They are the strongest swordsmen in Nissaka.

00:12:57.290 --> 00:13:00.050
Funaki Ichidensai's sons?

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:02.760
Ichidensai...

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:07.970
His lower jaw was sliced off by Sensei
during a match before the lord long ago.

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:15.980
However, the lord said Sensei
lacked manners and punished him for it.

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:20.360
Maybe he hasn't forgotten that humiliation...

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.820
In any case, the country is at peace.

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:26.740
Even if the dojos of the Kogan Style and Funaki agreed...

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:32.620
...to have matches with real swords,
cutting heads off as if in battle is...

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.830
They probably won't even agree to it.

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:37.420
What do we say to them in the first place?

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:40.340
Asking to have matches for us to choose the successor?

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:42.670
There's a limit to even being illogical.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:49.090
The order Sensei gave us this time is way too unreasonable.

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:52.100
However, Sensei's order is absolute.

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:56.100
It's our duty as his apprentices to follow it without objection.

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:12.160
Around 6 A.M., Nakayama Pass in Sayo...

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:26.550
The name Sayo comes from the word Sai,
which means "obstruct."

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:30.180
The name Nakayama means "boundary."

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:40.730
Do you know why this rock cries?

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:46.360
I heard that it used to be a god
of obstruction that protected travelers...

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:48.400
...by blocking evil spirits.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:52.950
However, one day...

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:58.160
...a pregnant woman named
Oishi went to Kikukawa village to work.

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.870
On her way home, her stomach suddenly started hurting.

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:02.540
When she was suffering from it...

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:08.130
...that samurai couldn't just leave her there.

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:11.010
So, he tended to her with great care, but...

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:27.690
The woman was killed by a Kamaitachi.

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:33.070
Her soul possessed this rock and started sobbing.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:38.410
Nissaka sure is a dangerous place...

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:08.230
Big Brother...

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:13.780
Why don't you get married and relieve our father?

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:20.160
I have to be careful when choosing
a bride since she'll be a wife to both of us.

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:35.180
Both our body and soul are purified.

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:54.740
Who are you?!

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:58.950
Do you realize that we're
Hyouma and Kazuma of the Funaki Dojo?

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:00.580
If you wanted to have a match...

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:04.960
...it's samurai code to let us know the time and place beforehand.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:07.710
We're not samurai.

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:10.960
We're Kamaitachi from Nakayama Pass.

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:18.720
You're such weak supernatural beings.

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:22.730
We'll use our style to teach you a lesson.

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:52.000
Kabuto Wari...

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:01.930
Fujiki...

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:14.940
I can move quicker than him...

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:16.200
I can...

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:31.540
Simultaneous hits wouldn't work...

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:33.800
It wouldn't...

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:36.470
Come on, already.

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:38.050
The sun will rise while you're dilly-dallying.

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:41.510
Are you scared now, Kamaitachi?

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:42.680
No.

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:43.810
Men of the Kogan Style.

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:53.440
Oh, it's you, Fujiki from Kakegawa.

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:07.250
If a Kogan Style man lifts his
sword above his shoulder, be careful.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:11.830
What can he do... with this much distance?

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:13.460
He's far...

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:16.170
He's too far from me.

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:36.280
Big Brother...

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:39.950
You're far...

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:43.160
You can't even graze...

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:51.210
The smallest slashing attack that
can slay the opponent in an instant...

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:55.460
It is a secret technique passed on only to those
who are Naka-Mokuroku and above in the Kogan Style.

00:19:56.670 --> 00:20:01.430
This technique, which is strictly prohibited
from being used during practice at the dojo...

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:05.010
...is called Nagare.

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:11.100
Big Brother!

00:20:52.640 --> 00:21:00.030
Ichijiku, ninjin, sansho, shiitake.

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:07.240
Gobou, mukuroju, nanakusa, hatsutake.

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:07.570
Kyuuri, tougan.

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:08.410
Irako...
Kyuuri, tougan.

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:10.370
Kyuuri, tougan.

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:12.910
Rinse your mouth.

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:05.300
<b>Fujiki Gennosuke, Irako Seigen
Under Iwamoto Kogan, soon these two came to be called the 'two dragons</b>

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:14.140
<b>End: Kamaitachi</b>

00:23:45.070 --> 00:23:49.780
<b>Next Chapter: A Children's Song</b>
